"A new brand, a new supply, a price offer or your company's progress. Staff check the text (no phone numbers or addresses), finance sends the invoice, and it goes out in the next issue.": "Birandii haaraa, dhiyeessii haaraa, kennaa gatii ykn guddina dhaabbata keessanii. Hojjettoonni barreeffama ni sakatta'u (lakkoofsa bilbilaa ykn teessoo malee), faayinaansiin nagahee ni erga, maxxansa itti aanu keessatti ni ba'a.",
