"A supplier you signed up by phone or in person. They sign in to the supplier portal with this mobile number and password, receive only the requests in their categories, and can keep their own price list. Documents can be added later from their portal.": "Dhiyeessaa bilbilaan ykn qaamaan galmeessitan. Lakkoofsa moobaayilaa fi jecha icciitii kanaan poortaala dhiyeessaa seenu, gaaffiiwwan gosa isaanii keessa jiran qofa argatu, tarree gatii mataa isaanii qabachuu danda'u. Galmeewwan booda poortaala isaanii irraa dabalamuu danda'u.",
"A tile in the moving price strip on the home page, or a slide in the banner inside every member's workspace.": "Iddoo tokko sarara gatii sochoo'u fuula jalqabaa irra jiru keessatti, ykn siliidii baanarii fuula hojii miseensa hundaa keessatti.",
