"Categories, dispatch point, status and the price list of any supplier. Prices you save here are what the supplier sees in the portal and what requests are pre-filled from.": "Gosoota, bakka ergaa, haala fi tarree gatii dhiyeessaa kamiiyyuu. Gatiiwwan asitti olkaa'attan kanneen dhiyeessaan poortaala keessatti argu fi gaaffiiwwan irraa guutaman dha.",
"Categorisation, supplier verification, support, newsletter, finance, tariffs and brands. Staff only.": "Gosa ramaduu, mirkaneessa dhiyeessitootaa, deeggarsa, xalayaa oduu, faayinaansii, taarifaa fi birandiiwwan. Hojjettoota qofaaf.",
