"Check text and pictures: no phone numbers, addresses or prices.": "Barreeffamaa fi suuraa sakatta'aa: lakkoofsa bilbilaa, teessoo ykn gatii hin qabaatin.",
"Check the number, or register as a supplier. For the demo you can also tap one of the test suppliers above.": "Lakkoofsa ilaalaa, ykn akka dhiyeessaatti galmaa'aa. Qormaataaf dhiyeessitoota qormaataa armaan olii keessaa tokko tuquu dandeessu.",
"Check the text (no phone numbers, addresses or prices), then publish.": "Barreeffama sakatta'aa (lakkoofsa bilbilaa, teessoo ykn gatii hin qabaatin), achii maxxansaa.",
