"Choose": "Filadhu",
"Choose a main category (first tap) and up to five more. Requests are sent to you only for these.": "Gosa ijoo (tuqaa jalqabaa) fi hanga shanii dabalataa filadhaa. Gaaffiiwwan kan isiniif ergaman kanneen kanaaf qofa.",
"Choose a picture": "Suuraa filadhu",
"Choose at least one category.": "Yoo xiqqaate gosa tokko filadhaa.",
"Choose on the request whether the supplier delivers, you collect, or Build Smartly arranges transport. You can pin the exact site on the map or use your location, and add transit insurance ({1} % of the goods value). When the truck leaves you get a {2}-digit handover code by SMS; check the goods, then give the code to the driver, who types it on their tracking page. Giving the code is your signature that you received the goods.": "Gaaffii irratti dhiyeessaan akka geessu, isin akka fudhattan, ykn Build Smartly geejjiba akka qopheessu filadhaa. Bakka sirrii kaartaa irratti mallattoo gochuu ykn iddoo keessan fayyadamuu, akkasumas inshuraansii geejjibaa ({1} % gatii meeshaa) dabaluu dandeessu. Yeroo konkolaataan ka'u koodii harka-kennaa lakkoofsa {2} SMS'n argattu; meeshaa mirkaneessaa, achiin koodii konkolaachisaaf kennaa, innis fuula hordoffii isaa irratti galcha. Koodii kennuun mallattoo keessan kan meeshaa fudhattan ta'uu mirkaneessuudha.",
"Choose on the request whether the supplier delivers, you collect, or Build Smartly arranges transport. You can pin the exact site on the map or use your location, and add transit insurance ({1} % of the goods value). When the truck leaves you get a {2}-digit handover code by SMS; check the goods, then give the code to the driver, who types it on their tracking page. Giving the code is your signature that you received the goods. Then check each item on the order page within {3} hours: received in full, or a problem with a photo.": "Gaaffii irratti dhiyeessaan akka geessu, isin akka fudhattan, ykn Build Smartly geejjiba akka qopheessu filadhaa. Bakka sirrii kaartaa irratti mallattoo gochuu ykn iddoo keessan fayyadamuu, akkasumas inshuraansii geejjibaa ({1} % gatii meeshaa) dabaluu dandeessu. Yeroo konkolaataan ka'u koodii harka-kennaa lakkoofsa {2} SMS'n argattu; meeshaa mirkaneessaa, achiin koodii konkolaachisaaf kennaa, innis fuula hordoffii isaa irratti galcha. Koodii kennuun mallattoo keessan kan meeshaa fudhattan ta'uu mirkaneessuudha. Achiin meeshaa tokkoon tokkoon fuula ajajaa irratti sa'aatii {3} keessatti mirkaneessaa: guutummaan ga'eera, ykn rakkoo suuraa waliin.",
"Choose on the request whether the supplier delivers, you collect, or Build Smartly arranges transport. You can pin the exact site on the map or use your location, and add transit insurance ({1} % of the goods value). When the truck leaves you get a {2}-digit handover code by SMS; give it to the driver and confirm receipt on the order page.": "Gaaffii irratti dhiyeessaan akka geessu, isin akka fudhattan, ykn Build Smartly geejjiba akka qopheessu filadhaa. Bakka hojii sirrii kaartaa irratti mallattoo gochuu ykn bakka jirtan fayyadamuu dandeessu, akkasumas inshuraansii geejjibaa ({1} % gatii meeshaalee, gatii fakkeenyaa) dabaluu dandeessu. Yeroo konkolaataan ka'u koodii harka walitti kennaa lakkoofsa {2} qabu SMS dhaan argattu; konkolaachisaaf kennaatii fuula ajajaa irratti fudhachuu keessan mirkaneessaa.",
"Choose on the request whether the supplier delivers, you collect, or Build Smartly arranges transport. You can pin the exact site on the map or use your location, and add transit insurance ({1} % of the goods value, example rate). When the truck leaves you get a {2}-digit handover code by SMS; give it to the driver and confirm receipt on the order page.": "Gaaffii irratti dhiyeessaan akka geessu, isin akka fudhattan, ykn Build Smartly geejjiba akka qopheessu filadhaa. Bakka hojii sirrii kaartaa irratti mallattoo gochuu ykn bakka jirtan fayyadamuu dandeessu, akkasumas inshuraansii geejjibaa ({1} % gatii meeshaalee, gatii fakkeenyaa) dabaluu dandeessu. Yeroo konkolaataan ka'u koodii harka walitti kennaa lakkoofsa {2} qabu SMS dhaan argattu; konkolaachisaaf kennaatii fuula ajajaa irratti fudhachuu keessan mirkaneessaa.",
