"Offers appear under My requests, cheapest delivered price first, with the brand but not the supplier name. Press Accept best on a line, or Accept the best price on all lines. You can also counter a price or reject an offer. You get an SMS when offers arrive.": "Kennaawwan Gaaffiiwwan koo jalatti mul'atu, gatiin geessisaa caalaa rakasa ta'e dursa, birandii waliin garuu maqaa dhiyeessaa malee. Sarara tokko irratti Isa caalaa fudhadhu, ykn Gatii caalaa sararoota hunda irratti fudhadhu tuqaa. Gatii mormuu ykn kennaa diduus dandeessu. Yeroo kennaawwan dhufan SMS argattu.",
"Offers arrive by themselves within a few minutes. Or open the": "Kennaawwan daqiiqaa muraasa keessatti ofumaan dhufu. Yookaan bani",
"Offers arriving": "Kennaawwan dhufaa jiru",
"Offers arriving · {1} offer to compare": "Kennaawwan dhufaa jiru · kennaa {1} wal bira qabuuf",
"Offers arriving · {1} offers to compare": "Kennaawwan dhufaa jiru · kennaawwan {1} wal bira qabuuf",
"Offers per line": "Kennaawwan sarara tokkoon",
"Offers quoted on the platform": "Kennaawwan waltajjii irratti kennaman",
"Offers sent": "Kennaawwan ergaman",
"Offers sent, win rate, median response time, orders paid.": "Kennaawwan ergaman, sadarkaa mo'annaa, yeroo deebii giddu-galeessaa, ajajawwan kaffalaman.",
"Offers with the customer": "Kennaawwan maamila bira jiran",
"Offers you sent": "Kennaawwan ati ergite",
"On behalf of": "Bakka bu'uun",
"On delivery": "Yeroo meeshaan ga'u",
"On delivery · Yagout Pay": "Yeroo meeshaan ga'u · Yagout Pay",
"On delivery, through the Yagout Pay gateway; the platform fee of {1} % is charged to the supplier.": "Yeroo meeshaan ga'u, karaa Yagout Pay; kaffaltiin waltajjii {1} % dhiyeessaa irratti kaffalama.",
"On servers in Ethiopia, as required by the Personal Data Protection Proclamation. Your location and documents are private and are never shown on a public profile.": "Sarvaroota Itoophiyaa keessa jiran irratti, akka Labsii Eegumsa Odeeffannoo Dhuunfaa barbaadutti. Bakki fi sanadoonni kee dhuunfaa dha, piroofaayilii ummataa irratti gonkumaa hin mul'atan.",
"On servers in Ethiopia. Cross-border transfers only as the law allows.": "Sarvaroota Itoophiyaa keessa jiran irratti. Odeeffannoon biyya alaatti kan darbu akka seerri hayyamu qofa.",
"On shipping": "Yeroo ergamu",
"On the order page there is Report a problem. Build Smartly staff see it at once, track it until it is resolved, and answer within one working day. For anything else, write to support from your Mailbox or ask me to hand you over.": "Fuula ajajaa irratti Rakkoo gabaasi jira. Hojjettoonni Build Smartly battaluma argu, hanga furamutti hordofu, guyyaa hojii tokko keessatti deebii kennu. Waan biraaf, Sanduuqa ergaa keessan irraa deeggarsatti barreessaa ykn nama biraatti akka isin dabarsu na gaafadhaa.",
"On the way": "Karaa irra",
"On this device only": "Meeshaa kana qofa irratti",
"On time": "Yeroon",
"Once both parties agree to the contract, you pay the full amount on the order page: Telebirr, CBE Birr or a card through the Yagout Pay gateway, or a bank transfer to Build Smartly. The supplier prepares the goods once it is paid. The receipt is ready at once, under Documents and in your Statements.": "Erga gareen lamaanuu waliigaltee irratti walii galanii booda, gatii guutuu fuula ajajaa irratti kaffaltu: Telebirr, CBE Birr ykn kaardii karra Yagout Pay'n, ykn dabarsa baankii gara Build Smartly. Erga kaffalamee booda dhiyeessaan meeshaa qopheessa. Nagaheen battaluma Galmeewwan fi Ibsa keessan keessatti qophaa'a.",
"Once the supplier reconfirms and the buyer agrees, neither party may withdraw.": "Erga dhiyeessaan irra deebiin mirkaneessee bitaan waliigalee booda, gareen kamiyyuu of duubatti deebi'uu hin danda'u.",
"One account for buying and supplying. A supplier can also send requests.": "Herrega tokko bittaa fi dhiyeessuuf. Dhiyeessaan gaaffii erguus ni danda'a.",
"One account per person or organisation. Suppliers must hold a valid business licence. Documents are checked by staff before trading. Accounts with expired documents are restricted.": "Nama yookaan dhaabbata tokkoof herrega tokko. Dhiyeessitoonni hayyama daldalaa seera qabeessa qabaachuu qabu. Sanadoonni daldala dura hojjettootaan ni sakatta'amu. Herregoonni sanadoota yeroon isaanii darbe qaban ni daangeffamu.",
"One answer per item. Items you do not answer by": "Meeshaa tokkoof deebii tokko. Meeshaaleen hanga yeroo kanaatti deebii hin kennineef:",
"One-stop supplier for every stage of the build, from cement to finishing. Showroom and yard at Megenagna.": "Dhiyeessaa sadarkaa ijaarsaa hundaaf, simintoo irraa hanga xumuraatti. Bakka agarsiisaa fi oobdiin Megenagna irratti argamu.",
"Only buying? Sign in with your number": "Bittaa qofaa? Lakkoofsa keetiin seeni",
"Only registered suppliers can see requests and quote. A buyer number cannot sign in here.": "Dhiyeessitoota galmaa'an qofatu gaaffiiwwan ilaaluu fi gatii kennuu danda'a. Lakkoofsi bitaa asitti seenuu hin danda'u.",
"Only suppliers of that material see your lines. Your name stays hidden.": "Dhiyeessitoota meeshaa sanaa qofatu sararoota kee arga. Maqaan kee dhokataa ta'ee hafa.",
"Only the staff whose job needs it, and only with a log entry. Other members see your identity only in a purchase order. Nothing is sold or shared with advertisers.": "Hojjettoota hojiin isaanii barbaachisu qofa, galmee wajjin qofa. Miseensonni biroo eenyummaa kee ajaja bittaa keessatti qofa argu. Wanti tokkollee beeksiftootaaf hin gurguramu, hin qoodamus.",
"Only verified suppliers of the materials on your list. They see a customer number and the sub-city of delivery, never your name or exact address. Your identity appears only in the purchase order.": "Dhiyeessitoota mirkanaa'an meeshaalee tarree kee irra jiranii qofa. Isaan lakkoofsa maamilaa fi kutaa magaalaa itti geejjibni ta'u argu, maqaa kee yookaan teessoo sirrii kee gonkumaa hin argan. Eenyummaan kee ajaja bittaa keessatti qofa mul'ata.",
"Only your mobile number. Build your list, press Send, type the SMS code. That is the account. Your list is saved on your phone while you do it, so you can leave and come back.": "Lakkoofsa moobaayilaa kee qofa. Tarree kee qopheessi, Ergi tuqi, koodii SMS barreessi. Herregni sun qofa. Yeroo kana hojjettu tarreen kee bilbila kee irratti olkaa'ama, kanaaf bahee deebi'uu dandeessa.",
