"We are building one place where a contractor sends a list once, verified suppliers quote in writing, and the purchase order and contract are issued with a full record. Addis Ababa first, then the regional cities.": "Bakka tokko ijaaraa jirra: kontraaktarri tarree tokko al tokko erga, dhiyeessitoonni mirkanaa'an barreeffamaan gatii kennu, ajajni bittaa fi waliigalteen galmee guutuu wajjin ni kennama. Jalqaba Finfinnee, itti aansee magaalota naannolee.",
"We send a {1}-digit code by SMS, and we text you when offers are ready. That is your whole account. Suppliers never see your name, only a customer number.": "Koodii lakkoofsa {1} qabu SMS-n isiniif ergina, yeroo kennaawwan qophaa'anis ergaa barreeffamaa isiniif ergina. Herregni keessan kanuma qofa. Dhiyeessitoonni maqaa keessan gonkumaa hin argan, lakkoofsa maamilaa qofa argu.",
"Welcome to Build Smartly": "Baga gara Build Smartly dhuftan",
"Welding machine hire": "Kiraa maashinii weldingii",
"What buyers and suppliers write to each other on each purchase order. Staff can read every thread and answer on the order page.": "Waan bitattoonni fi dhiyeessitoonni ajaja bittaa tokkoon tokkoon isaa irratti wal barreessan. Hojjettoonni marii hunda dubbisuu fi fuula ajajaa irratti deebii kennuu danda'u.",
"What buyers received this month. Also in every member's Mailbox under Newsletter.": "Waan bitattoonni ji'a kana argatan. Akkasumas Saanduqa ergaa miseensa hundaa keessatti, Xalayaa oduu jalatti ni argama.",
"What can I help you with?": "Maal isin gargaaruu danda'a?",
"What each category covers": "Gosti tokkoon tokkoon isaa maal of keessaa qaba",
"What happens next": "Itti aansee maaltu ta'a",
"What is wrong?": "Maaltu dogoggore?",
"What members see under Newsletter, on top of the example issue.": "Waan miseensonni Xalayaa oduu jalatti argan, maxxansa fakkeenyaa irratti dabalamee.",
"What people ask us": "Gaaffiiwwan namoonni nu gaafatan",
