"What you supply": "Waan isin dhiyeessitan",
"Wheel loader hire with operator": "Kiraa wiil looderii, oofaa waliin",
"When does the buyer pay?": "Bitaan yoom kaffala?",
"When the buyer has checked the goods, ask for their {1}-digit handover code and type it here. A correct code confirms the delivery.": "Bitaan meeshaa erga mirkaneessee booda, koodii harka-kennaa lakkoofsa {1} gaafadhaatii as galchaa. Koodiin sirriin geejjiba mirkaneessa.",
"When the supplier dispatches your order, the driver gets a one-time link and shares the truck's location from their phone. Open the order page: the map shows the truck, the distance left and roughly when it arrives. The link ends at handover or after {1} hours, and no route history is kept.": "Yeroo dhiyeessaan ajaja keessan ergu, konkolaachisaan liinkii yeroo tokkoo argata, iddoo konkolaataas bilbila isaa irraa qooda. Fuula ajajaa banaa: kaartaan konkolaataa, fageenya hafe fi gara yeroo itti ga'u agarsiisa. Liinkiin harka-kennaa irratti ykn sa'aatii {1} booda xumurama, seenaan imala hin kuufamu.",
"When you accept an offer, Build Smartly issues the purchase order and reveals the supplier. The supplier reconfirms price and stock, then you read the contract on the order page and press Agree. From then on both sides are bound. The PO, the contract and later the receipt can be printed or saved as PDF from the order page.": "Yeroo kennaa fudhattan, Build Smartly ajaja bittaa kenna, dhiyeessaas ni mul'isa. Dhiyeessaan gatii fi kuusaa irra deebiin mirkaneessa, achii isin fuula ajajaa irratti waliigaltee dubbiftanii Raggaasisi tuqxu. Sana irraa jalqabee gareen lamaan ni hidhamu. PO, waliigaltee fi booda nagaheen fuula ajajaa irraa maxxanfamuu ykn akka PDF tti olkaa'amuu danda'u.",
"Where": "Eessa",
"Where are my offers?": "Kennaawwan koo eessa jiru?",
"Where each request or order stands. Restricted between you and the platform.": "Haala gaaffiin ykn ajajni tokkoon tokkoon isaa itti argamu. Isinii fi waltajjii qofa gidduutti kan hafu.",
"Where is my data kept?": "Odeeffannoon koo eessatti kuufama?",
"Where it shows": "Bakka itti mul'atu",
