"Who is buying, legal name and TIN. Needed once, before your first purchase order. You can also do it later, at your first Accept.": "Eenyutu bita, maqaa seeraa fi TIN. Al tokko qofa, ajaja bittaa keessan isa jalqabaa dura barbaachisa. Booda, yeroo kennaa jalqabaa fudhattanittis gochuu dandeessu.",
