"Why this matters: a supplier picks a brand from this list when quoting, and the buyer sees the brand instead of the supplier name until the purchase order. Keep one list per category so offers compare like with like. Add a logo and it shows next to the brand on every offer.": "Maaliif barbaachisa: dhiyeessaan yeroo gatii kennu tarree kana irraa birandii filata, bitataanis hanga ajaja bittaatti maqaa dhiyeessaa bakka birandii arga. Akka kennaawwan wal fakkaatu waliin madaalamaniif gosa tokkoof tarree tokko qabadhaa. Mallattoo dabaluun kennaa hunda irratti birandii bira mul'ata.",
