"Write to Build Smartly support about a request, an offer or a delivery. Amharic, Afaan Oromoo or English. Staff answer here and by SMS; the thread is kept with your account.": "Waa'ee gaaffii, kennaa ykn geejjibaa deeggarsa Build Smartly-tiif barreessaa. Afaan Amaaraa, Afaan Oromoo ykn Ingiliffaa. Hojjettoonni asittii fi SMS-n deebii kennu; mariin kun herrega keessan waliin kuufama.",
"Write to Build Smartly support about a request, an order or your documents. Staff answer here and by SMS.": "Waa'ee gaaffii, ajajaa ykn sanadoota keessanii deeggarsa Build Smartly-tiif barreessaa. Hojjettoonni asittii fi SMS-n deebii kennu.",
"Written from the records above.": "Galmeewwan olii irraa kan barreeffame.",
"Written from the records above. Copy it into a proposal to a brand, a supplier or a partner.": "Galmeewwan armaan olii irraa barreeffame. Yaada kennaa birandii, dhiyeessaa ykn michuu tokkoof qopheessitu keessatti garagalchaa.",
"Written under the Personal Data Protection Proclamation No. {1}/{2}.": "Labsii Eegumsa Odeeffannoo Dhuunfaa Lak. {1}/{2} jalatti kan barreeffame.",
