"Yes, reject it": "Eeyyee, didi",
"Yes, this is planned for launch. The Build Smartly bot will let you send your list as a message, a photo or an Excel file, and will send you notifications when offers arrive. The website and the bot share the same account and the same records.": "Eeyyee, kun yeroo eegalaaf karoorfameera. Bootiin Build Smartly tarree keessan akka ergaatti, suuraatti ykn faayilii Excel-tti akka ergitan isin dandeessisa, yeroo kennaawwan dhufanis beeksisa isiniif erga. Marsariitiin fi bootiin herrega tokkoo fi galmee tokko qooddatu.",
"Yes. You accept, reject or renegotiate each line separately, and you can split a line between two suppliers if both allow partial supply.": "Eeyyee. Sarara tokkoon tokkoon isaa adda addaan fudhachuu, diduu ykn irra deebiin mari'achuu dandeessu. Yoo dhiyeessitoonni lamaanuu dhiyeessa gartokkee hayyaman, sarara tokko dhiyeessitoota lama gidduutti qooduu dandeessu.",
"You": "Isin",
"You are": "Isin",
